v {xschem version=3.4.7 file_version=1.3
* ldo_erramp_cmos5l -- symbol for the SG13CMOS5L two-stage Miller OTA
* error amplifier (issue #20). See ldo_erramp_cmos5l.sch for the topology,
* its ratifying record (spec/decision-records/DR-0002-sg13cmos5l-device-
* topology.md), and the judgement calls that record left to this phase.
*
* Pin order matches the ipin/opin/iopin instance order in
* ldo_erramp_cmos5l.sch: INP, INN, OUT, VDD, VSS, IBIAS.
*
* VDD and IBIAS are the two pins the SG13G2 branch's ideal-VCVS
* placeholder (design/ldo_erramp_placeholder.sym, 4 pins) did not need and
* design/README.md predicted a real amplifier would: VDD is the 3.3 V
* analog rail, IBIAS is an external current input -- the gate/drain node
* of the on-block diode-connected PMOS an external source sinks Iref from.
}
G {}
K {type=subcircuit
format="@name @pinlist @symname"
template="name=x1"
}
V {}
S {}
E {}
L 4 -80 -80 80 -80 {}
L 4 80 -80 80 80 {}
L 4 80 80 -80 80 {}
L 4 -80 80 -80 -80 {}
L 4 -70 -50 -60 -40 {}
L 4 -70 -40 -60 -50 {}
B 5 -81.25 -41.25 -78.75 -38.75 {name=INP dir=in}
B 5 -81.25 38.75 -78.75 41.25 {name=INN dir=in}
B 5 78.75 -1.25 81.25 1.25 {name=OUT dir=out}
B 5 -41.25 -81.25 -38.75 -78.75 {name=VDD dir=inout}
B 5 -1.25 78.75 1.25 81.25 {name=VSS dir=inout}
B 5 38.75 -81.25 41.25 -78.75 {name=IBIAS dir=inout}
T {@name} -80 -94 0 0 0.2 0.2 {}
T {@symname} -78 84 0 0 0.2 0.2 {}
T {INP} -74 -30 0 0 0.15 0.15 {}
T {INN} -74 22 0 0 0.15 0.15 {}
T {OUT} 50 -8 0 0 0.15 0.15 {}
T {VDD} -52 -70 0 0 0.15 0.15 {}
T {VSS} -14 58 0 0 0.15 0.15 {}
T {IBIAS} 20 -70 0 0 0.15 0.15 {}
T {+} -74 -60 0 0 0.2 0.2 {}
T {-} -74 44 0 0 0.2 0.2 {}
